 human wills. In Aurion: Legacy of the Kori-Odan, you play as a Kori-Odan caught in a war that has lasted 5,000 years, fighting as Enzo and calling on Erine as you uncover the secrets of the bloodline.\n\nCombat is real-time and anime-styled, inspired by older 2D Tales games. Dash attacks leave enemies open before you use skills, and you can chain normal attacks into special and top-tier skills drawn from a pool of more than 50, in both aerial and grounded forms. The game also includes Aurionic awakenings. It is single-player with full controller support, and suits fans of action RPG combat."}}